  clock: 3  # 5f60
  nonce: 5f60  # 5f60
  message: "Investigated 2026-06-01 for cluster context. Parent set to INV-luhur (P1 violated, writer-contract META) because it spans three direct children: INV-lidul (config_fingerprint, still violated), INV-gizik (per-pass timer, still violated), INV-nihug (skipped_passes mirror, now pending_validation). Phase 6 PR2 (98533c0fff) closed these for analyzers inheriting TreeSitterAnalyzer._analyze_body via auto-stamping; ~14 analyzers that override analyze() entirely (go, csharp, java, python, html, javascript, xml, yaml_ansible, json, toml, make, manifest_targets, play-routes, plus enclosure-linker variants) bypass _analyze_body and remain affected. Doesn't duplicate any preexisting row — it's the override-path tail of three sibling INV-luhur children."  # 5f60
- op: discuss  # 94e5
  at: '2026-06-02T04:38:34Z'  # 94e5
  by: agent  # 94e5
