  clock: 4  # 94e5
  nonce: '94e5'  # 94e5
  message: "**Pass-23 confirmation observation.** Pass 23 explicitly enumerated AR `pass_version=None`. Result: exactly 14/84 ARs (16.7%) have pass_version=None, and they are the exact override-analyze() set listed in this WI's description:\n\n```\n['html', 'go', 'csharp', 'javascript', 'play-routes', 'yaml_ansible',\n 'xml', 'json', 'java', 'manifest_targets', 'toml', 'make', 'python',\n 'enclosure-linker']\n```\n\nWI-mipul's framing verified empirically. No scope change.\n\n**Adjacent observation (filed as separate INV-luhur discussion, F23.2):** `AnalysisRun.toolchain.name='python'` for ALL 84 ARs, including grammar-based passes like rust (which DO have `grammar_module='tree_sitter_rust'` populated). The toolchain dict IS populated on every AR (so it's not a missing-extension gap that WI-mipul covers); but the `name` field carries the runtime name, not the analyzer language. Different concern; recorded on INV-luhur to keep WI-mipul scope tight.\n\n**Lab notebook entry:** `~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/notebookjournal_06022026_0010_pass23.md`."  # 94e5
